  "Question": "You have 50 yuan to buy notebooks priced at 5 yuan each. After buying $n$ notebooks, you have $m$ yuan remaining, where $m=50-5n$. The variables in this process are:",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "50 and 5",
    "B": "$n$ and $m$",
    "C": "50 and $n$",
    "D": "5 and $m$"
  },
  "Correct Answer": "B",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "The values 50 and 5 remain unchanged during the process, so they are constants. The number of notebooks purchased, $n$, and the amount of money remaining, $m$, change, so they are variables.",
